  "$description": "Outspoken V10: Out navy, spoken silver; warm marigold orange scale replaces citron (31 Oct 2026). Marker 300 and accent 500 carry navy text; text on light surfaces uses marigold 800 or darker only. Color primitives remain fixed. Geometry and type values are reviewed local implementation tokens; owner artistic acceptance remains separate. R13 proposed (2 Nov 2026; owner acceptance of the final artwork is not recorded): OS stencil mark with the unchanged V5 outlined wordmark. Adds palette.silver-600 (Nickel 600), the inverse pair palette.inverse-light and palette.inverse-silver, palette.navy-deep and the wordmark.spokenOnLight, outInverse and spokenInverse aliases. All V5 and V10 values above are unchanged.",
