      "$description": "PROPOSED (R13, 2 Nov 2026), Nickel 600. Use: the S of the OS stencil mark and SPOKEN on light grounds. Measured WCAG contrast 4.56:1 on pearl #F1F3F6 and 5.07:1 on white #FFFFFF. Not for dark grounds (2.78:1 on navy #162760); use the inverse pair there. The existing nickel #A9AFBA (2.20:1 on white) is unchanged and stays the V5/V10 value until the owner accepts this proposal.",
